  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u_ab453f781760695f1fdbaebd_0",
      "kind": "title",
      "source": "Status bar",
      "sourceHash": "ab453f781760695f1fdbaebd32177ec597df33c6006dc57b92d16968c058bfba",
      "context": "Status bar",
      "contextHash": "0bc4c2af5c39ad1f2312c9237789069d507e0c4daefe678266523b3177ac8b81",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_df8979fdcf6ba047dd7b1f0f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The status bar displays information about the current note and allows changing settings related to it such as configuring the language or attributes.",
      "sourceHash": "df8979fdcf6ba047dd7b1f0f07c0626f674c8869286be3278316509af81511ee",
      "context": "Status bar",
      "contextHash": "0bc4c2af5c39ad1f2312c9237789069d507e0c4daefe678266523b3177ac8b81",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1ae3df73d4e95bbbb10a6ce2_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Layout and interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "1ae3df73d4e95bbbb10a6ce223c4a5bf0403a0cb1218026f484da3b6997a7c4f",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_71bbf316c7d7731361f8aacb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On the left side, the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Breadcrumb__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is displayed which indicates the current note as well as its parent notes and allows for quick navigation throughout the hierarchy.",
      "sourceHash": "71bbf316c7d7731361f8aacb5c95ac6f6ac7ab5b9425a7551464b1a5a3d1a4b7",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6d972f8447a8885b85778ba2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On the right side, specific sections will show depending on the type of the current note.",
      "sourceHash": "6d972f8447a8885b85778ba264539a34a7cae4576b83e8b096551b86f8d37b0f",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7ce06646bc12b9678522f745_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For __TRILIUM_PH_0__Code__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes, the language mode of the note is indicated (e.g. JavaScript, plain text), as well as allowing easy switching to another mode.",
      "sourceHash": "7ce06646bc12b9678522f74576bc927a900e65e06c2268ff1c2fd3375bddd78b",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a789b92974eda3d99f84b990_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Before it, the position of the cursor is shown as a line and a column, such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ln: 12 Col: 32__TRILIUM_PH_1__. It updates as the cursor moves. While text is selected, the number of selected characters follows, such as __TRILIUM_PH_2__Selected: 120__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "a789b92974eda3d99f84b9905b1ddfbdb51acc1f8f0dd80fa09ff906a46e9b86",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6aa4f4d0dfe1f31bf34cdbb3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes, the content language is displayed and can be changed, thus configuring the spell-check and the right-to-left support.",
      "sourceHash": "6aa4f4d0dfe1f31bf34cdbb3b8458447fbf9a4ec4b8d97ce6a85fd62f9ca6eb4",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f93e501c38433ae0a8d5bee_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Note that this applies to the entire note and not the selection, unlike some text editors.",
      "sourceHash": "4f93e501c38433ae0a8d5bee2594a90d99676d76895b77257eef11611ac6d348",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_469dcd221b5d0babc843b16f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If a note is placed in multiple places in the tree (cloned), the number of the note paths will be displayed.",
      "sourceHash": "469dcd221b5d0babc843b16f944c8999022e386ecb40c06a2196594b8b9810b2",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2fcb4456bed9f852da5bf25b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking it opens a popup with the full list of note paths, from which the note can also be cloned to a new location. The same list is available in the sidebar's __TRILIUM_PH_0__Connections tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "2fcb4456bed9f852da5bf25bb669ae406c6b6abf15141447207e237727cc62c5",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3af835fad3abf4542f2f3607_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If a note has attachments, their number will be displayed.",
      "sourceHash": "3af835fad3abf4542f2f360734eaeec70457947a892ec8d0b7e7253bb3e5b0f5",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_04f394fe7bcd32b24a5887f2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on it will reveal the list of attachments in a new tab.",
      "sourceHash": "04f394fe7bcd32b24a5887f22b1f95e0b6b3413a20dbe3fd4c0df535c59ca76f",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_119792d969ded55097cfb053_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If a note is linked from other text notes (backlinks), the number of backlinks will be displayed.",
      "sourceHash": "119792d969ded55097cfb053c443eadaf6d7b56f07a8e2adf4568e402d1876dd",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eeb47e4591d49a36ed08910d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on it opens a popup with the list of notes that link to this note, as well as an excerpt of where the note is referenced. The same list is available in the sidebar's __TRILIUM_PH_0__Connections tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "eeb47e4591d49a36ed08910dc7ca90a5f3f819cccda3088a6b9062a488860f7f",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a8b6d339453b460d60f41331_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Regardless of note type, the following items will always be displayed if there is a note:",
      "sourceHash": "a8b6d339453b460d60f41331b35d96fcd9f89d8b8e7e9ee826e64b4d368c4774",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4da791186ff42255264af9e8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Note info, which displays:",
      "sourceHash": "4da791186ff42255264af9e850c7b2478c3b7a4e2ce7b842342deeb4a2fd9af4",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_deab8e38e907770593ccae3c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The creation/modification date of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "deab8e38e907770593ccae3c0680796a662acdd0242d57a8440ae443588f03f1",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a323a5b7012903d420f31645_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The type and MIME of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "a323a5b7012903d420f316459315c78dafb5b4d52e6b320dae06440225b8cf78",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a1a5539932e269dd18e7f6a9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The note ID.",
      "sourceHash": "a1a5539932e269dd18e7f6a9d554c7b75c51182b6592e30070f5073831a4dbe4",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d15a14a32e5d00ddf79bc28a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "An estimation of the note size of the note itself and its children.",
      "sourceHash": "d15a14a32e5d00ddf79bc28af0b3c81ae0afb2185b71a3291ca775d6f2e1b2c5",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a9ec1c19c3f4651559c3fe1a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A button to reveal the Similar notes in the sidebar's __TRILIUM_PH_0__Connections tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "a9ec1c19c3f4651559c3fe1a90d7c49825f5db95e53d8fbc392e3a2559f4587b",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f0ac6c45dc4ca671d94d1e34_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When pressing a button which reveals the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Right Sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_1__, it has a specific behavior if the sidebar is hidden: the sidebar will be peeked instead of docked. Regardless the sidebar will be switched to the appropriate tab and the corresponding section will be highlighted.",
      "sourceHash": "f0ac6c45dc4ca671d94d1e342b2ce1c34704c9606cd2d5b63d5d4b801e794c2d",
      "context": "Status bar > Layout and interaction",
      "contextHash": "cc0d6d67445706d64a152f0404071590bd7fecf9c725816dd9f9d2d5c36835c8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
  ],
